  "notes": [
   "An order code is LTV-817, then the package letter (M or S), then the taping code (TA, TA1, TP or none), then the CTR rank (A, B, C, D, L or none); LTV-817S-TA1-C is the surface-mount part on TA1 tape in rank C. A code with no rank covers the full 50 % to 600 %.",
   "On TA and TA1 tape the parts lie with their pin rows across the tape, turned half a turn from each other: on TA the pin-1 dot sits toward the far side from the sprocket holes, on TA1 toward the sprocket holes. On TP tape the parts lie with their pin rows along the tape.",
   "Every type is a single channel. Safety approvals listed: UL 1577 (E113898), CSA CA5A (1020087), FIMKO, NEMKO, DEMKO and SEMKO to EN/IEC 60950-1 and EN/IEC 60065, VDE DIN EN60747-5-5 (40015248), CQC GB8898-2011 / GB4943.1-2011. RoHS compliant; ESD HBM 8000 V, MM 2000 V; MSL 1."
